# Scratch spreadsheets stay on the machine that edits them.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# Except these two, which the academy needs to reach through the browser.
#
# horarios.xlsx is the workbook the academy uploads, and the one the site is
# rebuilt from — a file nobody can see from GitHub is a file nobody without a
# terminal can replace. ejemplo-completo.xlsx is the filled-in example they
# download and copy from, written by scripts/data/make-example.mjs.
!horarios.xlsx
!ejemplo-completo.xlsx
